<p>Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>1. Khud yaad hoga usko paani tha usne roka<br />
khuddar wo bohot hai sharminda humse hoga<br />
pyaase hai saare bachhe, usko na ye batao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>2. Dekho woh chal raha hai maidaa'n mein ladkhada kar<br />
girne se pehle akbar, usko sambhalo jaakar<br />
aye mere shahzade, jaldi qadam badhao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>3. Abbas apne dil se, har baat saaf kardo<br />
maa Fatima ke sadqe, hur ko muaaf kardo<br />
jakar alam ke usko, saaye mein leke aao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>4. Beta hussain qaidi, kaise kisiko dekhe<br />
meri taraf se kholo, tum uske haaath jaake<br />
baba khafa nahi hai, jaakar use batao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>5. Tum se bhi pehle marne, jaega uska beta<br />
jee bhar ke dekhle wo, apne pisar ka chehra<br />
kam waqt reh gaya hai, jaakar use batao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>6. Taa hashr ye karimi, sab yaad hi rakhenge<br />
mehmaan ka paseena khud saaf hum karenge<br />
fizza hamari maa ka rumaal leke aao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>7. Jis dum suni ali ki beti ne ye sadaein<br />
aasu bahake usko, dene lagi duaein<br />
bachho'n se phir ye boli, hur ko gale lagao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>8. Maa Fatima ke lab par uske liye dua hai<br />
ghurbat mein usne hum par ehsaan kar diya hai<br />
Hur ke ghulam ko bhi , izzat se leke aao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>

<p>9. Sajjad kya bayaa'n ho kehti thi bint e zahra<br />
bhai ki jaa'n bachane ek aur habib aaya<br />
mera salaam fizza pohchake usko aao<br />
Hur aa raha hai akbar, seene use lagao..(2)</p>